    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42260,42360,42576,42672,43036,43124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42156</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレらが行ったヴァルハラと、
この世界のヴァルハラ、ずいぶん違ったよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Valhalla we went to before and the
Valhalla in this world are pretty different, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたちの時代のヴァルハラは
もっときれいだったけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, the Valhalla in our
time was a lot prettier...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、この時代のヴァルハラの方が
温かかったよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But this era's Valhalla feels
a lot warmer, somehow?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42468</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうかな、オレはちょっと寒くて
上着欲しかったぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh, you think so? I was a bit
chilly. Kinda wanted a coat, actually.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42580</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことじゃなくて、
なんか人の心が温かかったってこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's not what I mean. Like, the
people were more warmhearted.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42676</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私は貧しくても、
心が温かな方が好きだな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It might be poorer, but I like
the warmhearted one more...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>確かにそうかもだけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, yeah, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、それってオレらが
よそ者だかんだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Isn't that just 'cause
we're outsiders?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>当人たちにしたら、
金のあった方がいいと思う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I bet the villagers themselves
would rather have money.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……そう、なのかな……
そうかも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... I wonder...
You might be right...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43128</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_030_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、本当に
それでいいのかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But would that
really be better?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
